title: SelaNursery
---
Taren: The drill marks curl around the eggs. Whoever dug this was careful. #emotion:Worried
Sela: Those aren't drill marks. This bend is on my chart of the Gullet. #emotion:Shocked
Taren: A passage, curled around an egg. Is that what grows here? #emotion:Curious
Sela: New routes. The survey charts mark this whole chamber as empty space. #emotion:Worried
Taren: Will the outer beacon read a route that moves? #emotion:Curious
Sela: I'll mark the living passage here. The beacon can read it alongside the survey key. #emotion:Determined
Taren: We'll keep the drill quiet. Let's get back to the surface. #emotion:Tender
===
